/* l-icons 通行证 · 钥匙开场(proto/icons icons.css .ky*,px × 1.923 = rpx)。只用 transition,没有 keyframes;减少动态效果直接终态。 */
.ky { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; color: #FFFFFF; background: #0A0908 radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 55% at 50% 30%, #1A1410 0%, #0A0908 70%); } /* ds-ok 原型 .ky 定值(烤帧的底色要和它一致) */
.ky--plain { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--cy-bg-page); } /* 商家账号:只剩导航和空态,空态占满剩余高度(cy-fill-state 要父级是 flex 列) */
.ky__stage { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 750rpx; height: 1000rpx; z-index: 2; }
.ky__layer { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
.ky__layer--idle { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 420ms ease; }
.ky__layer--idle.is-on { opacity: 1; }
.ky__grad { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 62%; z-index: 1; transform: translateY(100%); transition: transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1);
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 9, 8, 0) 0%, #3A1408 38%, #9A3310 68%, #E0541C 92%, #FF6F2D 100%); } /* ds-ok 原型 .ky-grad 暖橙渐变 */
.ky-g .ky__grad { transform: translateY(22%); }
.ky__skip { position: absolute; right: 32rpx; z-index: 5; min-height: 64rpx; line-height: 64rpx; padding: 0 12rpx; font-size: 28rpx; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .75); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 500ms ease; } /* ds-ok 原型 */
.ky__skip.is-on { opacity: 1; }
.ky__txt { position: absolute; left: 56rpx; right: 56rpx; bottom: calc(92rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); z-index: 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
.ky__in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16rpx); transition: opacity 550ms ease, transform 550ms var(--cy-ease-out); }
.ky__in.is-on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
.ky__eb { font-size: 22rpx; letter-spacing: .32em; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72); margin-bottom: 24rpx; } /* ds-ok 原型 .ky-eb */
.ky__h { font-size: 50rpx; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: 20rpx; } /* ds-ok 原型 ps-key 标题逐值(同文件其余原型值的做法) */
.ky__p { max-width: 540rpx; font-size: 28rpx; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); margin-bottom: 44rpx; } /* ds-ok 原型 .ky-p */
.ky__btn { align-self: stretch; height: 100rpx; border-radius: 50rpx; background: #FFFFFF; color: #111111; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 32rpx; font-weight: 600; } /* ds-ok 原型白药丸 */
.ky--reduced .ky__grad, .ky--reduced .ky__in, .ky--reduced .ky__layer--idle, .ky--reduced .ky__skip { transition: none; }

/* 细节打磨二期(2026-11-12)L1/L5/L7:卡面层次、按压松手回弹、读数等宽;只改质感,不动版式/文案/配色 */
.ky__btn { transition: transform var(--cy-motion-press-out) var(--cy-ease-release), opacity var(--cy-motion-press-out) var(--cy-ease-out); }
